    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "30fb824b-c1da-5eb7-912e-ffbe86b1c23f",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrices\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}, B = \\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}, C = \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & -1\\end{bmatrix}$.\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. $AB = BA = I_{2}$\n2. $AC = CA = I_{2}$\n3. $B = A^{-1}$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We must check whether each pair multiplies to $I_2$.\n\nComputing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -1 \\\\ -\\frac{1}{2} & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\".",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "2955bdb5-0fe8-5824-97f9-071a5f00e0ab",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "1aa0d026-025b-5743-9e09-3912541ab33c",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "4e78f4fc-cbde-5524-9d80-8781e8f24c16",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "None"
